{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>由TVB唱跳節目《魔音女團》打造的全新女子組合MYNT，今日（29日）推出第二首新歌《純粹好感》，首度挑戰抒情慢歌，MV中六位成員大派福利，甜度爆燈！當中倪嘉雯（Carmen）更罕有展露A4纖腰，畫面極度吸睛，究竟邊位成員嘅「女友感」造型最煞食？</p><p>《魔音女團》MV場景曝光 六美展現純愛GFable造型</p><p>今次新歌《純粹好感》MV，MYNT一改首支快歌的型格性感路線，改以純白純愛Look及Gfable甜美居家造型示人，前者仙氣滿滿，後者則甜美可愛。MV團隊更打造了森林、Home Sweet Home及沙灘三大主題場景，讓六位成員各自與MV男主角展現不同層次的戀愛甜蜜感。當中包括宋宛穎（Sabrina）的「枕頭大戰」、倪嘉雯（Carmen）「甜蜜聽歌」、喬美莎（Chelsea）「煙韌入廚」、倪樂琳（Ellyn）「耍花槍打機」、盧映彤（Skylar）「佻皮晾衫」，以及莊子璇（Hilary）的「浪漫沙灘漫步」，每個畫面都充滿戀愛氛圍。</p><figure><img alt=\"（圖片來源：TVB）\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/vs-youtube-328myntofficialmvmynt-youtube-105_13518818636abbec9ed750c-1024x576.jpg\"/><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/vs-youtube-328myntofficialmvmynt-youtube-106_14626325196abbeca1151b7-1024x576.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/vs-youtube-328myntofficialmvmynt-youtube-104_2518690936abbeca48b421-1024x576.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/vs-youtube-328myntofficialmvmynt-youtube-103_3568840416abbeca8dca0e-1024x576.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>倪嘉雯A4腰成焦點 倪樂琳居家Look超搶鏡</p><p>在眾多Gfable造型中，以倪嘉雯（Carmen）及倪樂琳（Ellyn）的居家造型最為搶鏡。其中一幕Carmen坐在客廳地板上「伸懶腰」，不經意地將其「A4」纖腰完美展露，配上她的招牌甜美傻笑，完美演繹出「呆萌傻女友」的感覺，令粉絲心動。而倪樂琳（Ellyn）的背心打機造型同樣充滿女友感，展現活潑一面。另外，盧映彤（Skylar）的「尖面丸子頭」造型亦被讚相當可愛，成功俘虜粉絲。</p><p>出道一個月火速推新歌 挑戰抒情慢歌</p><p>MYNT由宋宛穎（Sabrina）、倪嘉雯（Carmen）、莊子璇（Hilary）、倪樂琳（Ellyn）、喬美莎（Chelsea）及盧映彤（Skylar）六位成員組成，上月才推出首支型格快歌《Turn My Magic On》正式出道。事隔僅一個月，她們火速推出第二首派台作品《純粹好感》，更是TVB節目《女神配對計劃 2》的插曲。今次首度挑戰抒情慢歌，展現出與以往截然不同的甜美少女風格，足見她們的可塑性極高。</p><p>網民洗版大讚：女友感滿分！</p><p>MV推出後，網民反應極之熱烈，紛紛留言大讚六位成員的新造型。不少網民將焦點放在成員們的「女友感」上，留言洗版式討論：「Carmen條腰真係屈機！睇到心心眼！」、「好想同Ellyn一齊打機，個樣好gfable！」、「六個都好靚，今次行純情風好啱佢哋！」、「MV拍得好有戀愛feel，睇完成個人都甜哂！」、「Sabrina玩枕頭大戰好可愛，反差萌！」。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/02_11262076156abb62311bbfd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/03_6041618026abb6234f39f1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/04_21393254126abb623931485.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/05_18112842196abb623f20b0a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/06a_20198414806abb6245a5671.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/06_21404488876abb6249e9e07.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/07_6412019256abb6250ab211.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/08_75598396abb62554ba5e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/09_1875307116abb6259d1103.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/10_1935838586abb625e0fbbf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/11a_8075404996abb62625b382.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/11_16371666726abb6268264b4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/12a_16206431456abb626ccf5dd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/12_17248225956abb627402c01.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/13a_8703178956abb627995f68.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/13_20012027536abb627e98fd5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14_5824266826abb6284f1d35.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14a_4175189486abb628989207.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/16_621288876abb628f55383.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17_1276485726abb6294583f4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/18_7455358776abb629f3b98a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/19_2360306126abb62b03a3aa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20_13005414026abb62b51995b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/21_1638604246abb62bb1ad52.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/23_3566175986abb62c59fe18.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/24_2227029836abb62c9de694.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/25_20659474366abb62ce095c7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/26_3899479776abb62d1ec751.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/27_2634379626abb62d5b090a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T03:20:19.420577+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1336,"images":33,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}